"guid":"debcd592-8d53-71f1-fc15-5c8b8ef9df6e","description":"Pittsburgh Steelers","sportId":28,"teamId":23,"team":{"id":23,"description":"Pittsburgh Steelers","abbreviation":"PIT","shortDisplayName":"Steelers","links":{"mobile":{"teams":{"href":"https://www.espn.com/nfl/team/_/name/pit/pittsburgh-steelers"}},"web":{"teams":{"href":"https://www.espn.com/nfl/team/_/name/pit/pittsburgh-steelers"}}}}},{"id":1637,"type":"team","uid":"s:20~l:28~t:25","guid":"985a261f-296c-c95c-32a5-addc4df75001","description":"San Francisco 49ers","sportId":28,"teamId":25,"team":{"id":25,"description":"San Francisco 49ers","abbreviation":"SF","shortDisplayName":"49ers","links":{"mobile":{"teams":{"href":"https://www.espn.com/nfl/team/_/name/sf/san-francisco-49ers"}},"web":{"teams":{"href":"https://www.espn.com/nfl/team/_/name/sf/san-francisco-49ers"}}}}},{"id":1693,"type":"team","uid":"s:20~l:28~t:26","guid":"3767a23c-a17d-294f-288a-9086ad1f0680","description":"Seattle Seahawks","sportId":28,"teamId":26,"team":{"id":26,"description":"Seattle Seahawks","abbreviation":"SEA","shortDisplayName":"Seahawks","links":{"mobile":{"teams":{"href":"https://www.espn.com/nfl/team/_/name/sea/seattle-seahawks"}},"web":{"teams":{"href":"https://www.espn.com/nfl/team/_/name/sea/seattle-seahawks"}}}}},{"id":2091,"type":"team","uid":"s:20~l:28~t:27","guid":"13e8b157-a75a-ff24-ae91-fa3d52ddf204","description":"Tampa Bay Buccaneers","sportId":28,"teamId":27,"team":{"id":27,"description":"Tampa Bay Buccaneers","abbreviation":"TB","shortDisplayName":"Buccaneers","links":{"mobile":{"teams":{"href":"https://www.espn.com/nfl/team/_/name/tb/tampa-bay-buccaneers"}},"web":{"teams":{"href":"https://www.espn.com/nfl/team/_/name/tb/tampa-bay-buccaneers"}}}}},{"id":2886,"type":"team","uid":"s:20~l:28~t:10","guid":"0a0aea59-9a5e-01b3-57a3-0151cf4bf393","description":"Tennessee Titans","sportId":28,"teamId":10,"team":{"id":10,"description":"Tennessee Titans","abbreviation":"TEN","shortDisplayName":"Titans","links":{"mobile":{"teams":{"href":"https://www.espn.com/nfl/team/_/name/ten/tennessee-titans"}},"web":{"teams":{"href":"https://www.espn.com/nfl/team/_/name/ten/tennessee-titans"}}}}},{"id":1462,"type":"team","uid":"s:20~l:28~t:28","guid":"fbeaf73e-6d6c-cca4-0809-713d9d741f90","description":"Washington Commanders","sportId":28,"teamId":28,"team":{"id":28,"description":"Washington Commanders","abbreviation":"WSH","shortDisplayName":"Commanders","links":{"mobile":{"teams":{"href":"https://www.espn.com/nfl/team/_/name/wsh/washington-commanders"}},"web":{"teams":{"href":"https://www.espn.com/nfl/team/_/name/wsh/washington-commanders"}}}}},{"id":701887,"type":"contributor","guid":"3139123a-2bc7-3127-b40d-448cdb859378","description":"ESPN Staff Profile","slug":"espn-staff-profile","contributor":{"id":2462,"description":"ESPN Staff Profile"}}],"keywords":["NFL","NFL Draft","Arizona Cardinals","Atlanta Falcons","Baltimore Ravens","Buffalo Bills","Carolina Panthers","Chicago Bears","Cincinnati Bengals","Cleveland Browns","Dallas Cowboys","Denver Broncos","Detroit Lions","Houston Texans","Jacksonville Jaguars","Kansas City Chiefs","Las Vegas Raiders","Los Angeles Chargers","Miami Dolphins","Minnesota Vikings","New England Patriots","New Orleans Saints","New York Giants","New York Jets","Philadelphia Eagles","Pittsburgh Steelers","San Francisco 49ers","Seattle Seahawks","Tampa Bay Buccaneers","Tennessee Titans","Washington Commanders","ESPN Staff Profile"],"story":"<p><video1></p>\n<p>The <a href=\"https://www.espn.com/nfl/draft/news\">2027 NFL draft</a> is still months away, but with the <a href=\"https://www.espn.com/nfl/schedule\">2026 season</a> underway, we're starting to track pick order in Round 1. Which teams are in position to add <a href=\"https://www.espn.com/nfl/draft/bestavailable\">elite prospects</a> in the top 10 next April? What about the top five ... or even at No. 1?</p>\n<p>What follows is not the current draft order based on records. It is a projection of what ESPN's <a href=\"https://www.espn.com/nfl/fpi\">Football Power Index</a> thinks the order <em>ultimately</em> will be by the end of the season. Each week during the season, the FPI projects the draft order by simulating the remainder of the season 10,000 times. Game probabilities are based primarily on the model's team ratings and game locations. The draft order is determined by the records the model projects for each team after 17 games, as well as each team's average draft position across the simulations.</p>\n<p>So where do things stand? Here are the full sortable projections, complete with each team's chances to pick in the top five, in the top 10 and at No. 1.</p>\n<center>\n<p align=\"center\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.espn.com/nfl/draft/news\">See more on the NFL draft</a></strong></p>\n</center>\n<p><img src=\"http://a.espncdn.com/i/infographics/20170710_nfl_fpr/charts/_end_rule.png\" width=\"100%\"></p>\n<p><strong>First-round picks that have been traded:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>The <a data-clubhouse-guid=\"06cd3bcf-7a86-53d4-28e7-aa049dd36261\" href=\"https://www.espn.com/nfl/team/_/name/gb/green-bay-packers\">Green Bay Packers</a>' selection was dealt to the <a data-clubhouse-guid=\"b0fc8fb7-9dbe-e574-9008-6f0ee7c6b234\" href=\"https://www.espn.com/nfl/team/_/name/dal/dallas-cowboys\">Dallas Cowboys</a> in the <a data-player-guid=\"19e0d5a6-9c4e-83d1-c9c2-5cfa322727f5\" href=\"https://www.espn.com/nfl/player/_/id/4361423/micah-parsons\">Micah Parsons</a> <a href=\"https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/46098144/sources-micah-parsons-traded-packers-gets-record-contract\">trade</a>.</li>\n<li>The <a data-clubhouse-guid=\"582d14eb-da61-e505-cc40-d972a1b60ed1\" href=\"https://www.espn.com/nfl/team/_/name/ind/indianapolis-colts\">Indianapolis Colts</a>' selection was dealt to the <a data-clubhouse-guid=\"732d3caf-b350-1e34-48c6-b7cebb4a0d88\" href=\"https://www.espn.com/nfl/team/_/name/nyj/new-york-jets\">New York Jets</a> in the <a data-player-guid=\"4a3e8bb3-8d6a-7208-dc0f-7cf148b34c1b\" href=\"https://www.espn.com/nfl/player/_/id/4427250/sauce-gardner\">Sauce Gardner</a> <a href=\"https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/46847491/sources-jets-trade-sauce-gardner-colts-2-first-rounders\">trade</a>.</li>\n<li>The <a data-clubhouse-guid=\"2e1473b2-e269-fd7a-1137-c1edacb85986\" href=\"https://www.espn.com/nfl/team/_/name/lar/los-angeles-rams\">Los Angeles Rams</a>' selection was dealt to the <a data-clubhouse-guid=\"539babc5-e5fb-753b-8ae1-c15032a91ef4\" href=\"https://www.espn.com/nfl/team/_/name/cle/cleveland-browns\">Cleveland Browns</a> in the <a data-player-guid=\"031d8156-6271-ea30-409f-137309621805\" href=\"https://www.espn.com/nfl/player/_/id/3122132/myles-garrett\">Myles Garrett</a> <a href=\"https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/48939456/sources-browns-rams-finalizing-myles-garrett-blockbuster-trade\">trade</a>.</li>\n<li>The better of Dallas' two selections (either its own pick or the Packers' original pick) was dealt to the Jets in the <a data-player-guid=\"b299da3f-168e-d279-dc79-8d7b0d926def\" href=\"https://www.espn.com/nfl/player/_/id/4040982/quinnen-williams\">Quinnen Williams</a> <a href=\"https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/46848422/sources-jets-trade-quinnen-williams-cowboys\">trade</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<p><inline1></p>\n\n\n\n\n","allowAMP":true,"allowAds":true,"allowComments":true,"allowCommerce":true,"allowContentReactions":true,"allowSearch":true,"byline":"ESPN staff","isLiveBlog":false,"links":{"api":{"self":{"href":"https://content.core.api.espn.com/v1/sports/news/49794361"}},"app":{"sportscenter":{"href":"sportscenter://x-callback-url/showStory?uid=49794361"}},"mobile":{"href":"http://m.espn.go.com/nfl/story?storyId=49794361"},"web":{"href":"https://www.espn.com/nfl/draft2027/story/_/id/49794361/2027-nfl-draft-order-projections-first-round-picks"}},"premium":false}],"breakingNews":[],"timestamp":"2026-09-28T13:57:22Z","status":"success"}